          <h3>Detail Without Losing Context</h3>
          <p>
            Users can move from community-wide demand to a participant and then
            to individual appliances, switch between hourly and minute-level
            views, compare on consistent chart scales and reset or zoom without
            turning analysis into a specialist-only task.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class='content-wrapper flex-layout column gap'>
          <h3>Performance as Part of the Experience</h3>
          <p>
