      <span class='chapter-label'>What six years of ownership taught me</span>
      <h2>Beyond the Launch: A Living Product</h2>
      <p class='section-lede'>
        COMET is not a finished redesign frozen in a portfolio. It is a living
        platform that has had to survive field constraints, an architectural
        transition, team turnover, real users and the edge cases that only
        appear in production. My role has been to hold the product intent steady
        while continually improving how that intent is expressed in design and
        code.
      </p>

      <div
